; Sphynx from "input/sphynx.webp", drawn by hand.
; Motion follows refs/local/cat_ref/move.pxl. Identity: thin and leggy (belly raised 1 row),
; hairless (smooth outline, wrinkle dashes, no whiskers), huge flared ears, big pale-blue eyes,
; grey mask/paws/whip tail, pink skin.
